From 53c8eeb729d5ed9f52d9251e856fb8c262c36230 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:18:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(entities): discard stale passenger links

A remove-entity packet can arrive before the related link update. Keep vehicle passenger lists in sync when actors despawn, and prune unknown passengers before encoding Java passenger packets so bulk removals do not disconnect the client. Also clear the local mount state when its vehicle disappears.
---
 .../protocol/PlayerActionPacketFactory.java   |  9 ++-
 .../protocol/packet/InteractionPackets.java   | 33 ++++----
 .../protocol/storage/EntityTracker.java       | 23 +++++-
 .../protocol/storage/EntityTrackerTest.java   | 77 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/test/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/protocol/storage/EntityTrackerTest.java

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/protocol/PlayerActionPacketFactory.java b/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/protocol/PlayerActionPacketFactory.java
